>	1) How can you make holy/unholy water?  I tried dropping uncursed
>water and unholy water on a lawful altar and nothing happend other than
>telling me it was uncursed/unholy.  I then converted the altar to neutral and
>the same thing happens.  I have not found a chaotic altar yet.

	This was changed from version 3.0j of the game.  Here's how to do it
in version 3.1.2:  Drop all your potions of water on an altar with the same
alignment as your character and #pray.  To create unholy water, do the same on
a non-co-aligned altar (note:  your patron deity will be very annoyed if you
do the latter.)

>	2)  I was on about level 15 or so when I received a telepathic message
>from the elder of my tribe.  I found a magic portal and was sent back to my
>village to fight off a butt-load of ogres and trolls.  I get to the elder and
>he tells me that I must track Thoth Anon (sp?) to find a magical amulet called
>the Heart of (something with an H).  Is this just a personalized quest to get
>the Wizard and Amulet of Yendor or is it something else entirely.  I cannot
>leave the screen of the village except thru the portal which brought me there.

	This is a class-specific quest which you will need to complete before
you can get the Amulet.  Search the level carefully for a secret door guarding
a staircase.  In addition to your Quest Artifact, your Nemesis (Thoth Amon, in
your case) will be carrying an item you absolutely must have in order to find
the Amulet.  Asking the Oracle (the expensive questions) might enlighten you
further.

